# Data Deletion Policy

**F.L.A.M.E.S Online ❤️**

## Data Deletion Request

F.L.A.M.E.S Online does not store personal user data on external servers.

All inputs (such as names entered for compatibility checks) are processed locally on your device and are not saved or transmitted.

## What Data Can Be Deleted?

Since the app does not collect or store personal data, there is no user data retained that requires deletion.

Any temporary data used during app usage is automatically cleared when the app is closed or reset.

## Requesting Data Deletion

